- SKIP sinal (escopo **1.1**): SSOT `signal_skip` — `mini_pair_oppose`, `cal_margin` (waive pending)
- Veto ML: container `aether-loss-classifier` → `gate_reason=loss_clf_veto`; log `LOSS_CLF || VETO auto_learn=0|1 …`
- `min_direction_margin` padrao **0.022** em **[0.015, 0.05]**; nao restaurar quality gate / Hurst/ADX/RSI/price_zone
- SCALE adapta lado + soft Kelly; **sem** SKIP por escala
- EXEC_EMPTY / `gate_reason` coerente = processo ok
